WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.126 --> 00:00:02.419
Check me out. I'm a man.

00:00:02.794 --> 00:00:04.630
I do what I want. I go where I want.

00:00:04.713 --> 00:00:07.674
I have the right to vote.
I can legally own property.

00:00:07.758 --> 00:00:09.510
-What are they so afraid of?
-Maybe they're scared

00:00:09.593 --> 00:00:12.346
that if they teach us how the world works,
we'll figure out how to take over.

00:00:17.518 --> 00:00:19.061
Oh my God, she's so insane.

00:00:19.853 --> 00:00:22.105
Of course she's insane.
She's Emily Dickinson.

00:00:25.776 --> 00:00:27.861
You're gonna make
a good housewife one day, Emily.

00:00:29.696 --> 00:00:31.031
Oh, yeah. I'm a real catch.

00:00:31.907 --> 00:00:33.951
You need to cut out these sort of antics.

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:35.285
Are you getting married?

00:00:39.373 --> 00:00:40.874
I have one purpose...

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.213
and that is to become a great writer.

00:00:46.964 --> 00:00:48.674
Because I could not stop for Death

00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:51.718
He kindly stopped for me

00:00:53.971 --> 00:00:54.972
Nice to see you.

00:00:59.643 --> 00:01:03.480
Emily, I realized, without you,
I might as well not exist.

00:01:03.897 --> 00:01:06.233
You really are
my favorite person in the world.

00:01:08.277 --> 00:01:09.403
Read it when I'm gone.

00:01:09.486 --> 00:01:10.904
You mean... when you're dead?

00:01:11.405 --> 00:01:13.198
Dude, no, I mean,
like, when I'm in the other room.

00:01:13.282 --> 00:01:14.283
Oh.

00:01:14.366 --> 00:01:16.368
I do not approve of a woman

00:01:16.451 --> 00:01:19.788
seeking to build herself
a literary reputation, Emily!

00:01:22.124 --> 00:01:23.125
I am a poet.

00:01:24.668 --> 00:01:27.838
And there is nothing you can do
to stop me.

00:01:43.270 --> 00:01:44.354
You're gonna be a great poet...

00:01:46.607 --> 00:01:48.275
the world will never forget.

